From 04bba92cf15c974ca58e21f571d7c4645b78771f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hayaksi1 <193020925+hayaksi1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 19:51:12 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Give the relocated tests names the runner collects

Ten test files that contribution branches add at the old apps/web/test
layout are pulled into apps/web/src by git's directory-rename detection,
which moves them but does not rename them. apps/web/vitest.config.ts
collects src/**/*.test.{ts,tsx}, so a file landing as X-test.ts sits in the
right directory under a name nothing runs - present in the tree, counted by
every ancestry check, and never executed.

Renames them to X.test.ts and repoints the relative imports they carried
over from the old layout, including the two slash-command specs that still
reached for a helper which now lives in ./__mocks__.

Fork-Feature: fork-tooling
